{"v":4,"catch":"與惡魔共舞","desc":"《Devil May Cry》系列第2作，故事發生於前作結束多年後。本作追加了Wall Hike和Rainstorm等技能，使Dante的動作變得更加華麗和豐富多彩。此外，除了Dante的故事外，玩家還可以選擇遊玩女主角Lucia的故事。力量型的Dante和速度型的Lucia，兩名主角能力特性各異。另外，額外模式「Bloody Palace」更於本作首次登場。\n\n繼續經營萬能事務所的Dante，接受了一名有Dumary島「守護者」之稱的紅髮美女Lucia之邀請而到訪了Dumary島。在島上，Dante遇上了十分熟識魔劍士Sparda的Lucia母親Matier，從她身上得知了Arius企圖復活霸王Argosax的計劃，並受託阻止其陰謀。","publisher":"CAPCOM","release":"2019-09-19","genres":["動作","冒險","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.9GB / Switch 1.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/503e8da0b01641c119f1f7c25e6eed62130d906515abeb59417061462dfb8f1b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/efaad165dbe7c635dcca5fbf2798a245374c31376d610be59475ad9a47f8101f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/40611bb79d21f06aa27eb6061e2f6407d42085f3cab2ce7c494c0453c7b59216.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e779cbb66ca32078bb3c49d0de01087386c79bc657930c11c2172f2cc19985a5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9bdbf1d7008f5cc53f8071f447ee8fbbae3fede654dc3fb041f42b860978ff2c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fb210bb0a14603bfadde3469296fe1ba62aa84408383c10f4d8caeec0e3d3161.jpg"],"titleId":"01007cf00d5ba000","dlc":[]}